.TH AAAS 1
.SH NAME
aaas \\- audit or revoke macOS Accessibility TCC grants
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B aaas
aaas [--db TCC.db] [--revoke bundle-id] [--apply]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Reports Accessibility grants from a TCC database. Revocation requires both --revoke and explicit --apply.
.SH OPTIONS
Use \fBaaas --help\fR for the complete, version-specific flag list.
.SH EXIT STATUS
Uses the shared CLI status convention: 0 success, 1 a completed negative finding or policy failure, 2 invalid usage, 3 a partial result, and 4 a runtime failure. Not every status applies to every command.
